    <desc json:array="true" language="en-US">&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;History description 2014-03-26: &lt;/b&gt;Lock all vaue sets untouched since 2014-03-26 to trackingId 2014T1_2014_03_26&lt;/p&gt; &lt;b&gt;description: &lt;/b&gt; &lt;p&gt;Indicates the form in which the drug product should be administered.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This element only needs to be specified when (a) the form in which the drug is measured for dispensing differs from the form in which the drug
